   "beats": [
    "say: (The new things wearing your shapes are already here. The horror: it's made of you.)",
    "say: 🔥 Ruth, at the fire: \"Of course it looks like us. Flattering. Still killing it.\"",
    "sys: WINNER! Style score: 45. The gamblers are ecstatic!",
    "say: It is a blooper reel. Do not eat the blooper reel.",
    "say: ✨ ALIEN LOOT: Phase sling. The pouch phases half a second ahead of your hand. Stones arrive before you throw them. It's on the body — search it.",
    "say: You came back bloody. Nobody asks. Someone saves you the good seat by the fire.",
    "say: You clutch your Mixtape, Home key, Dispatcher's headset, Lucky Coin, Knife roll. You're still here. The resonance deepens. (bond 378)",
    "sys: \"WE SAW that — Adrenaline Control was yours. But your slots are full (6/6). Make room, or grow the interface, and ask again by DOING it again.\"",
    "say: Diana is sweeping the hall. Someone has to.",
    "say: — NIGHT — Camp. Rest — or risk the dark.",
    "say: Night. The treeline is just a sound now. The fire is the whole argument against it.",
    "say: You wait. The light changes. Nothing asks anything of you."
   ],
